      "statement": "The repository's authoritative position on this area is docs/DEVIATIONS.md §0: apps/server is an admin CRUD API only, apps/mobile is an untouched Expo starter, and packages/shared is types plus Zod schemas — which is why the authoritative specification for routing, AR and trust is the design docs and ADRs rather than code.",
